---
import catalog from '../../../data/martin/index.mjs';

const appendix = catalog.parts[6].units[0];
---

<nav class="appendix-contents" aria-labelledby="appendix-a-contents-title">
  <h2 id="appendix-a-contents-title">附录目录 | Appendix contents</h2>
  <ol>
    <li><a href="#reference-orientation">使用定位 | Reference orientation</a></li>
    <li><a href="#source-map">来源地图 | Source map</a></li>
    <li><a href="#objects-and-conventions">数学对象与约定 | Objects and conventions</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-a-1">A.1 基本定义与变分方程 | Basic definitions and variational equations</a></li>
    <li><a href="#constrained-variation">约束变分 | Constrained variation</a></li>
    <li><a href="#second-variation">二阶变分与稳定性 | Second variation and stability</a></li>
    <li><a href="#section-a-2">A.2 含梯度的 DFT 泛函 | DFT functionals including gradients</a></li>
    <li><a href="#boundary-conditions">边界项与边界条件 | Boundary terms and conditions</a></li>
    <li><a href="#cross-references">正文交叉引用 | Chapter cross-references</a></li>
    <li><a href="#review">误判、练习与来源边界 | Review and sources</a></li>
  </ol>
</nav>

<section id="source-map" class="chapter-source-map" aria-labelledby="appendix-a-source-title">
  <h2 id="appendix-a-source-title">来源地图 | Source map</h2>
  <p>
    下表只记录 Martin 原书的目录标题和印刷页定位。网站正文、推导、图形和练习均为原创，不转录教材正文或习题。
  </p>
  <p lang="en">
    The table records only Martin's directory titles and printed-page locators. The website exposition, derivations, diagrams, and exercises are original and do not reproduce the textbook body or exercises.
  </p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>原书位置 | Source locator</th>
        <th>原节标题 | Source section</th>
        <th>网站覆盖 | Website coverage</th>
        <th>状态 | State</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {appendix.sections.map((section) => (
        <tr>
          <td>{section.id}, printed p. {section.page}</td>
          <td>{section.title}</td>
          <td>{section.id === 'A.1' ? '定义、方向变分、泛函导数、约束变分与二阶变分' : '含梯度泛函、分部积分、边界项和 DFT 连接'}</td>
          <td>substantive draft</td>
        </tr>
      ))}
      <tr>
        <td>Exercises, printed p. {appendix.exercisesPage}</td>
        <td>Source exercises not reproduced</td>
        <td>原创推导、极限和数值检查练习 | Original derivation, limit, and numerical checks</td>
        <td>original replacement</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>

<style>
  .appendix-contents {
    margin-block: 1.5rem 2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--sl-color-gray-5);
    border-radius: 0.65rem;
    padding: 1rem 1.1rem;
    background: var(--sl-color-gray-7);
  }

  .appendix-contents h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .appendix-contents ol {
    columns: 2;
    column-gap: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .appendix-contents li {
    break-inside: avoid;
    margin-block: 0.35rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 50rem) {
    .appendix-contents ol {
      columns: 1;
    }
  }
</style>
